{"steamAppId":1304680,"description":"Unleash chaos in Voidigo, a vividly animated roguelite shooter packed with dynamic boss battles, zany weapons, and playful humor.\n\nSelect from an array of ranged and melee weapons to combat the looming corruption. Master the art of dodging and stun your enemies with stomps to tip the balance in your favor.\n\nVoidigo's numerous bosses, corrupted by the void, offer fierce resistance. They may flee mid-battle, giving you a choice: pursue or regroup. However, hesitate too long, and they'll begin hunting you.\n\nIn your battle, collect diverse power-ups for exciting synergies. Trade weapons and resources to customize your playstyle.","short_description":"A vividly animated action roguelite focused on boss hunting. Unleash an array of diverse weapons and powerups to combat the corruption of the Void.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304680/header.jpg?t=1773305310","developer":"semiwork","publisher":"semiwork","genre":"Экшены, Приключенческие игры, Инди","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок","Многопользовательская","Кооператив"],"playerCount":28,"releaseLabel":"8 июн. 2023 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":97,"steamReviewCount":4929,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304680/ss_355fb13edf49aa8cb404789572b72d4b9bb7c499.600x338.jpg?t=1773305310","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304680/ss_355fb13edf49aa8cb404789572b72d4b9bb7c499.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773305310"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304680/ss_f4643f934b82c7384e4b6ef0a809ddcbcf68c5a2.600x338.jpg?t=1773305310","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304680/ss_f4643f934b82c7384e4b6ef0a809ddcbcf68c5a2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773305310"},{"id":2,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets